     "a629f1cc-27c9-41e0-8790-0babcda2d61a"], Cell["\<\
Pairs of vertices at distance r, projected to the first vertex\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6cd98ef7-78ed-4620-88b6-1c8d4587c963"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
