Cell["Exact finite observations at scale", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8ba19138-861c-4518-8408-2544cd81dcc4"],

Cell["\<\
An observation rule must specify what becomes visible at a chosen scale. \
Balls, powers, covers and partitions perform different operations. None is \
selected by the inert fibered-graph object itself.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a8e6d095-54fb-4450-8419-fc6f6664a144"],

